<title>USA: Macsaver Financial may issue $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Macsaver Financial may issue $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macsaver Financial Services is expected to issue $100 million in five-year debt, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a Ba1/BBB-minus rated five-year issue via lead underwriter Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be launched late Thursday, sources added.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
